{"version":1,"content":"<html>\n<body><p>更新時間：21:15 2026-11-12 HKT<br/>發佈時間：21:15 2026-11-12 HKT</p>\n<p>發佈時間：21:15 2026-11-12 HKT</p><p>朱敏瀚早前綵排台慶時受傷，再參與台慶序幕，他報平安只是撻一撻沒事，不知大家拍得好快，過5分鐘已收到好多慰問短訊，強調整個拍攝安全亦已預錄好，屆時還有一個現場吊威也演出，入行以來吊威也最多一次，會同好兄弟有驚喜演出。</p><img alt=\"朱敏瀚拍攝TVB《萬千星輝賀台慶》序幕。\" src=\"https://image.hkhl.hk/f/1024p0/0x0/lr/sthl/3b271852805f987bed1acfc73c1edaa4/2026-11/WhatsApp_Image_2026-11-12_at_20_11_51.jpeg\"/><img alt=\"朱敏瀚早前綵排台慶時受傷。\" src=\"https://image.hkhl.hk/f/1024p0/0x0/lr/sthl/cb441dc5c94637cadc1197baa55e1973/2026-11/WhatsApp_Image_2026-11-12_at_20_11_52.jpeg\"/><img alt=\"朱敏瀚受傷後報平安。\" src=\"https://image.hkhl.hk/f/1024p0/0x0/lr/sthl/b88040168f3f6202b711ae784cb43e3e/2026-11/WhatsApp_Image_2026-11-12_at_20_11_53_1_.jpeg\"/><img alt=\"朱敏瀚多謝陳曉華關心。\" src=\"https://image.hkhl.hk/f/1024p0/0x0/lr/sthl/6e4a6b58dd79bcaf0d85b23e958ab649/2026-11/WhatsApp_Image_2026-11-12_at_20_12_03_2_.jpeg\"/><img alt=\"朱敏瀚和陳曉華再見變成陌生人。\" src=\"https://image.hkhl.hk/f/1024p0/0x0/lr/sthl/3c3ca4e932fbbe7cfe4966bfd459a713/2026-11/WhatsApp_Image_2026-11-12_at_20_12_35_1__0.jpeg\"/><img alt=\"朱敏瀚攀爬一個綠色巨型箱子道具並試圖翻越鐵絲網。\" src=\"https://image.hkhl.hk/f/1024p0/0x0/lr/sthl/87680e9357ad2974e0dc2b60d8972e1b/2026-11/179448762236250.jpeg\"/><img alt=\"朱敏瀚着地。\" src=\"https://image.hkhl.hk/f/1024p0/0x0/lr/sthl/e84ff6c2dc361abda56deeccc8d246b1/2026-11/179448743991973.jpeg\"/><img alt=\"朱敏瀚、劉穎鏇、周嘉洛與張振朗都練得滾瓜爛熟。\" src=\"https://image.hkhl.hk/f/1024p0/0x0/lr/sthl/e58ba51d6ff16946f2357719288f3e79/2026-11/179448743911606.jpeg\"/><h2>朱敏瀚嚇到媽媽急叫回電</h2><p>提到陳曉華得知他出意外，他表示多謝，有收到很多人關心，感開心，更嚇到媽媽即叫他回電報平安，但沒禁止他演出，強調有驚有喜但安全，首次同錢家班合作好榮幸。</p><p>最Hit</p>\n</body>\n</html>","scraped_at":"2026-11-12T17:04:20.107569+00:00","quality":{"score":1,"chars":278,"images":8,"source":"星島頭條","fallback":"none","origin":"article-html","completeness":"extracted"},"published_at":"2026-11-12T13:15:09+00:00","fetched_at":"2026-11-12T18:17:54.828082+00:00","content_updated_at":"2026-11-12T16:57:51.297643+00:00","content_hash":"ce937436a32d14f0692dedf2b731daeba55b70e0c8f25446fa4f869491af8f43","evidence_status":"full","scrape_error":null,"content_retention":null,"content_capture":null}